serts to work with Flupper Domes\n- Updated apron primitive from VPW's The Simpsons Party\n- Small color and light corrections on the playfield texture\n- Added insert decals from the Emperor Mod\n- Added Instruction Cards provided by Carny Priest\n- New GI\n- Updated Rubber Dampeners (v.2.2)\n- Removed a lot of timers to improve performance (v.2.2)\n- VPW Tweak Menu added to replace the old VPW Options UI (v.2.2)\n- Slingshots are solenoid driven, based on VPW's Spider-Man Classic (v.2.2)\n- Added a second flasher dome inside the safehouse and edited the safehouse primitive (v.2.2)\n\nDaRdog:\n- Added VR Mega Room\n- New cab art and apron art\n- Big uprez in the playfield using AI\n\nDGrimmReaper:\n- Added key, new flipperbuttons,startbutton, screws on the siderails and plunger and animated them\n\nThemer (v.2.2):\n- Inverted VPM switch assignments 43 and 45 (both at the visibleLock and the 'Suitcase lock buttons'). Those switches were inverted\n- New code for the SolSniper sub and the entire sniper section\n- New code for the SolSafehouse sub and the entire safehouse section\n- New VPM solenoid assignment 21 for the suitcase motor\n- Removed the SuitRot property from the solSuitcase sub as this property is removed entirly\n- New MotorSuitcase sub and new code for the entire suitcase section\n\nLoadedWeapon (v.2.2):\n- Created a custom sideblades primitive to fit on Legends Cabinets and provided a secondary ini file for the POV to match\n\nSpecial thanks to everybody involved during development and testing :H3RBSKIx, geradg, BountyBob, Smaug, MikeDASpike, DarthVito, passion4pins, Apophis, m.carter78, somatik & guus_8005\n\nShoutout to:\n\n- Carny Priest for the instruction cards he gave us!\n- passion4pins for the backdrop he created for desktop players\n- freneticamnesic, Rascal, luvthatapex, Javier15, unclewilly, oooPLAYER1ooo, rom, zedonius, dark, ASOT, gtxjoe, ICPjuggla, 85vett, arngrim, 32assassin, DGrimmReaper and Emperor for their work on previous versions\n\nIf I didn't mention anybody else in this development cycle I am unaware of this and just know that I still think you are awesome and also want to say you rock!\nAnd basically everybody from VPW I didn't mention just for welcoming me into my new family, you all absolutely rock!⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀"
    }
